Package: difftrap
Title: Differential Expression Analysis for TRAP Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9009
Authors@R:
    person("Paul", "Klemm", , "paul.klemm@sf.mpg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5985-1737"))
Description: A DESeq2-based pipeline for differential expression analysis of
    TRAP (Translating Ribosome Affinity Purification) RNA-seq experiments
    with a source (IP/Input) by treatment factorial design. Imports Salmon
    quantifications via tximport, fits separate subset models for the
    non-interaction contrasts and a full interaction model for the
    interaction term, and applies apeglm shrinkage to all contrasts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
